@@ -405,13 +405,13 @@ A typical local configuration might look
 
 ```yaml
   -ruler.storage.type=local
-  -ruler.storage.local.directory=/tmp/loki/rules
+  -ruler.storage.local.directory=/var/lib/loki/rules
